  "description": "Gravel beast, super commuter, kit hauler, trail cruiser and shopper — the Bivio+ was designed with versatility and utility in mind. We blended the geometry of our gravel range with our legendary tourer, the Heritage, to create a frameset and bike that offers utility and adaptability, offering stable handling when you're loaded and a nod to fast, road handling when you're rushing to run an errand.Designed to carry everything for a self-sufficient, off-Tarmac adventure, you’ve got plenty of options to ride the way you want. The Bivio+ is based on decades of experience building our Cadet and Heritage touring bikes, the geometry allows you to front load and maintain your handling, even on tougher, muddier routes. Go beyond the traditional road tourer and gravel machine.If simplicity is your style, the Bivio+ has you covered. Add a front rack and basket, and you’re ready to collect your shopping, commute with your laptop securely up front, cruise to a local race with spare kit strapped to the rack.",
